.TH MMAP_SHARED_FD 3
.SH NAME
mmap_shared_fd \- create a shared mapping of a file descriptor and close it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mmap.h"
.PP
.BI "char* mmap_shared_fd(fd_type " fd ", size_t* " filesize ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mmap_shared_fd
maps the entire contents of the file descriptor
.I fd
into memory as a shared, read-write mapping and then closes the file descriptor.
The size of the file is stored in
.I filesize
upon success.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a pointer to the mapped memory on success, or NULL on failure.